WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.325
The laws are the same. Subtract the indices, even if the answer goes negative.

2
00:00:06.001 --> 00:00:08.901
Two squared over two squared cancels to one.

3
00:00:11.966 --> 00:00:15.741
Two minus three is minus one, so two to the minus one.

4
00:00:18.779 --> 00:00:21.004
Two minus four is minus two.
